---- MODULE UnicodeCounter ----
EXTENDS ℕ, Sequences

CONSTANT Max
VARIABLES n, log

vars ≜ ⟨n, log⟩
Init ≜ ∧ n = 0
       ∧ log = ⟨⟩
Inc(k) ≜ ∧ k ∈ 1‥Max
         ∧ n' = n + k
         ∧ log' = Append(log, k)
Next ≜ ∃ k ∈ ℕ : Inc(k) ∨ UNCHANGED vars
Spec ≜ Init ∧ □[Next]_vars ∧ ◇⟨Next⟩_vars ∧ WF_vars(Next)

TypeOK ≜ n ∈ ℕ ∧ ∀ i ∈ DOMAIN log : log[i] ∉ {0}
Fn ≜ [i ∈ 1‥3 ↦ i * 2]
Sig ≜ [a : ℕ → ℤ]
Live ≜ ◇(n = Max) ∧ (n = 0 ↝ n ≠ 1) ∧ (n ≤ 2 ⇔ n ≥ 0)
Sub ≜ {1, 2} ⊆ {1, 2, 3} ∖ {4}
Sqt ≜ ⟨1⟩ ⊢ ⟨2⟩
M ≜ INSTANCE Other
====
